  "Group": "Acquisition",
  "Category": "Media",
  "Description": "LiDAR Object Acquisition: acquires LiDAR Objects from the real world and provides them, and the Scene Descriptors of what it acquires where the Data Type exists. A LiDAR sensor gives a Basic LiDAR Object; a source on a disk or a network may give a Basic or a full LiDAR Object, and Basic or full Scene Descriptors. Its Qualifier states the sensor, its calibration and its mounting pose.",
